    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "KW Team Castles are delighted to present new to the market No 91 Dowland Road, Walkinstown. \r\n\r\nThis fine three-bedroom detached home, offering well proportioned, light filled accommodation but in some need of modernisation, includes a large attic room above. It is further complimented by a large private West facing rear garden with double-door side access from the front driveway and featuring a substantial self-contained workspace with three phase power supply, offering the potential to be converted into an annex at a future date (subject to planning permission).\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises of a porch entrance, spacious hallway, reception room to the front, large living-room to the rear, and kitchen overlooking the rear garden .Upstairs there are three bedrooms (two double and a generous single bedroom) and the family bathroom. A spiral staircase takes you to the attic room above. Located in this popular mature residential area, the property is within a short walk of Crumlin Village with its many shops, cafes and bars while the Ashleaf Shopping Centre is also closeby. \r\n\r\nIt is well served by public transport putting Dublin City Centre within easy reach. There is an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools in the vicinity.\r\n\r\nLarge West facing rear garden with large, self-contained workshop\r\nWell apportioned accommodation\r\nLarge kitchen\r\nOff-street parking\r\nHighly sought-after mature residential area\r\nExcellent range of primary and secondary schools"
      }
